       QQ__GGEETTSSTTAATTSS (supported up to Linux 2.4.21)
              Get statistics and other generic  information  about  the  quota
              subsystem.   The  _a_d_d_r argument should be a pointer to a _d_q_s_t_a_t_s
              structure in which data should be stored.  This structure is de‐
              fined in _<_s_y_s_/_q_u_o_t_a_._h_>.  The _s_p_e_c_i_a_l and _i_d  arguments  are  ig‐
